                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/21: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-07-20T18:00:00-04:00">July 20, 1933—6 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>65. Your 64, July 17, 3 p.m. Department will be ready to begin conversations by
                    the time Olaya’s technical advisers can arrive here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
